<title>USA: St Joseph hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST. JOSEPH 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    59.50-60.00</p>
<p>US 2-3	270-290 lbs    58.00-59.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-500 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>US 1-3	500-700 lbs    48.00</p>
</text>
